        "5.5. A company records the monthly sales of 4 products over 6 months in the DataFrame below.\n",
        "Product Jan Feb Mar Apr May Jun\n",
        "Product A 120 130 140 150 160 170\n",
        "Product B 100 110 120 130 140 150\n",
        "Product C 150 145 160 170 180 190\n",
        "Product D 90 100 110 120 130 140\n",
        "Perform the following:\n",
        "\n",
        "a. Total sales of each product using groupby / sum()\n",
        "b. Average monthly sales of each product\n",
        "c. Best-selling product overall\n",
        "d. Month with the highest overall sales\n",
        "e. Standard deviation of sales for each product\n",
        "e. Create a pivot table showing total sales per product per quarter (Q1: Jan–Mar, Q2: Apr–Jun)\n",
        "\n"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7jP_8URqjXKl"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "import pandas as pd\n",
        "\n",
        "data = {\n",
        "    \"Product\": [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"],\n",
        "    \"Jan\": [120, 100, 150, 90],\n",
        "    \"Feb\": [130, 110, 160, 90],\n",
        "    \"Mar\": [140, 120, 170, 100],\n",
        "    \"Apr\": [150, 130, 180, 120],\n",
        "    \"May\": [160, 140, 190, 130],\n",
        "    \"Jun\": [170, 150, 200, 150]\n",
        "}\n",
        "df = pd.DataFrame(data)\n",
        "print(\"og df: \")\n",
        "print(df)\n",
        "\n",
        "months = [\"Jan\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\", \"Apr\", \"May\", \"Jun\"]\n",
        "df[\"Total\"] = df[months].sum(axis=1)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\ntotal sales of each product: \")\n",
        "print(df.groupby(\"Product\")[\"Total\"].sum())\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\naverage monthly sales of each product: \")\n",
        "print(df[months].mean())\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nbest-selling product overall: \")\n",
        "print(df.loc[df[\"Total\"].idxmax(), \"Product\"])\n",
        "\n",
        "monthly_sales = df[months].values.flatten()\n",
        "print(\"\\nmonth with the highest overall sales: \")\n",
        "print(pd.Series(monthly_sales).idxmax())\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nstandard deviation of sales for each product: \")\n",
        "print(df[months].std())\n",
        "\n",
        "df[\"q1\"] = df[[\"Jan\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\"]].sum(axis=1)\n",
        "df[\"q2\"] = df[[\"Apr\", \"May\", \"Jun\"]].sum(axis=1)\n",
        "pivot_table = pd.pivot_table(df, values=[\"q1\", \"q2\"], index=\"Product\")\n",
        "print(pivot_table)"
